      "pinnedBy": null,
      "body": "> maybe [ros/urdfdom_headers@ff99bea](https://github.com/ros/urdfdom_headers/commit/ff99beac8ae27dfd8f5bef939ad31879ba137b62) breaks the build? [@clalancette](https://github.com/clalancette) any thoughts?\n\nHuh, interesting.  When building locally, I can't reproduce this.  But it *should* reproduce because https://github.com/ros/urdfdom/blob/cdd4b3c0867e159abcf9be97b44bd05f07b4ca73/CMakeLists.txt#L51 is too strict.  I'm not sure what is going on there.\n\nEither way, I'll open a PR to urdfdom to relax that.  It doesn't need to be that strict.",
      "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">maybe <a href=\"https://github.com/ros/urdfdom_headers/commit/ff99beac8ae27dfd8f5bef939ad31879ba137b62\">ros/urdfdom_headers@ff99bea</a> breaks the build? <a href=\"https://github.com/clalancette\">@clalancette</a> any thoughts?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Huh, interesting.  When building locally, I can't reproduce this.  But it <em>should</em> reproduce because <a href=\"https://github.com/ros/urdfdom/blob/cdd4b3c0867e159abcf9be97b44bd05f07b4ca73/CMakeLists.txt#L51\">https://github.com/ros/urdfdom/blob/cdd4b3c0867e159abcf9be97b44bd05f07b4ca73/CMakeLists.txt#L51</a> is too strict.  I'm not sure what is going on there.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Either way, I'll open a PR to urdfdom to relax that.  It doesn't need to be that strict.</p>",
